  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Admixture), Weather sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Admixture, you may spend an additional spell point to affect one target damaged by the destructive blast with a shroud effect you know in place of a second blast type. If you possess Encompassing Weather, you may apply the shroud to any targets damaged, up to your maximum targets from Encompassing Weather.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/admixture-feats#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
